": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593938515_1280604650866677_6852958439983670548_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BW5E-Cwhq6oQ7kNvwF_XXF2&_nc_oc=AdpnHb31zilqyKaLdNFyl7meenVYa-l4FwVWRCspkeX-jWfviRvdQfD17LqxJospqUM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDxO_JrcXgkSmP3nLJIVCG7e573kqvGwncoqvmWKaoemw&oe=6A68B3B1"}, {"file_name": "Title logo.png", "id": "873189941754699", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823366_873189945088032_7353295988527858865_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wLqwqZpUiKIQ7kNvwFaTPoa&_nc_oc=Ado-I2v5sOqX4zHQFH7mWL6uVjwyIXZXGj4TCuPJeRpBCcnRTgIM-yfIYgcf7-pRS2k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCobyCQzivOSMYgrgj_gbcCQQ44t9JgWjQ-Nk-FW1vUnA&oe=6A68C4D6"}]}, "id": "2809645762705651", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "Still 2.png", "id": "1613740816300459", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823270_1613740819633792_7534861503693310936_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X_50-qAJCJ8Q7kNvwHoxQZ7&_nc_oc=AdpwaNNCDvQN7sgyOZq-RxDnYCK5g8XH5RKGnUYTDzzFkpGH9rs_27zTnIHRmYbGdlU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBk4biQJtn4EgHgTXOsQB3s0i_3sZx4TMlb_iTQBhAYGg&oe=6A6895AE"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 2026-05-19 at 19.17.38.png", "id": "1548283590196631", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819854_1548283600196630_2624967657938474727_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jpAr6G3Awy4Q7kNvwHmERMt&_nc_oc=AdqecYP1evFvL1a4EyTqRsQzHqSZTOo42asi907qobdsrMYvNCxwB6BfvNNuvJu9ijU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDf-oWUT42julOBZACRCSn-d8FiQieFMPGftvAgvztBpg&oe=6A68BD98"}, {"file_name": "still 3.png", "id": "2364781913960894", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820558_2364781917294227_6286268374579906745_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yhXaELyihEcQ7kNvwFXNkIK&_nc_oc=AdrnIf8qo_fnYz2xEqBgQJbEI6AYS9IatV_2iZPinibtyjkpe0xscf8S2toE4s4KucI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCQA5JKlGkG13gTyj5jO0c65JuXYvvWvA3vVjgadsXFOw&oe=6A68C6E7"}, {"file_name": "still 6.png", "id": "1415620343253395", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819375_1415620346586728_7294806654877176970_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=55j7nhM6hu4Q7kNvwHzdaNL&_nc_oc=AdrrLpevQ2LmIjTdkC7QoNpRAsYdScooM_G681rbPt1P57DtYgmhdUJmflH3JHl4UWw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAzlgDVIOMio6vzUZC14kTokrIx0qPrOD9QpX4xq-n8bw&oe=6A68C29B"}, {"file_name": "still 1.png", "id": "1765534908166923", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821674_1765534911500256_4266532870211439759_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QzGG-xV-ItAQ7kNvwHxeAKw&_nc_oc=Adp0LHgK3RZ2UihoII3qAJQTu1sScBi3gHiPddx6016gx1JDNw5eJK-dP-sQu2F5Qb0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCrFrtzsRfsUiJ46_WmRNYFHf1ThjZU73iEVREjAkc_yg&oe=6A689676"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Who's the King?! - Assassin Update", "keywords": ["king", "simulator", "sandbox", "survival", "medieval"], "long_description": "# **\ud83e\udd77NEW FREE ASSASSINS UPDATE**\ud83e\udd77\nAvailable now for all players. Don\u2019t get killed!\n\n3 assassins can visit you!\n- Survive poison, bombs, stalkers & claim their deadly weapons. \n- Knock enemies down with headshots or blunt force.\n- 13 new weapons to unleash: explosives, bazookas, bow & arrows & even set enemies ablaze with torches. \n- Inventory: 13 foods, 20 weapons, 19 outfits & more to collect.\n\n{1918928978816754}\n                                         \n# \ud83d\udcacJOIN OUR DISCORD AND BECOME A LAUNCHER!!\ud83d\udde8\ufe0f\n\nhttps://discord.gg/TKAhFrUjcq\n\n# \ud83d\udc51 WHO\u2019S THE KING \ud83d\udc51\n\nSit on the throne, grab your sword, keep your eyes wide open, and decide who gets to enter your kingdom. Every visitor matters\u2026 and every mistake could cost you your crown. \ud83d\udc51\n\n{1128980472761253}\n\n# \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Protect your people\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f\n\nPlagues, criminals, traitors, danger is everywhere. Inspect newcomers, heal the sick, and stop threats before they spread like wildfire. \ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\n\n{1496286202200083}\n\n# \u2696\ufe0f Judge. Decide. Execute. \u2696\ufe0f\n\nSearch suspects, treat the wounded, cut off gangrened limbs, throw criminals into the dungeon\u2026 And if justice demands it? Off with their heads \ud83d\ude35\u200d\ud83d\udcab\u2694\ufe0f.\n\n{1271212228167016}\n\n\n# \ud83d\udd25 Avoid the Revolution! \ud83d\udd25 \nThe people are angry. Be fair, be smart, or be ruthless - but don\u2019t push them too far\u2026\nA bad king doesn\u2019t last long. \ud83d\udca5\n\n{1386775932368428}\n\n# \ud83e\ude77 Choose your Queen!  \ud83e\ude77\n\nRuling alone is boring, why not make one of your visitors your queen? Give her items, maybe she'll react differently!\n\n{1247756353992587}\n\nRule wisely\u2026 or lose everything. So tell us, Who\u2019s the King? \ud83d\udc40\ud83d\udc51", "short_description": "\ud83d\udc51 WHO\u2019S THE KING?! \ud83d\udc51\nSit on the throne, grab your sword and judge who enters your kingdom. Inspect newcomers, heal the sick, jail criminals\u2026 or cut off heads if needed. Power comes with ennemies, watch out for assasins! \nKeep the people happy or face a revolution. "}]}, "developer_name": "Kalank Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.arianestudios.com/whos-the-king-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ariane Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.arianestudios.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "27